    <string name="lesson_subdivisions_title">SUBDIVISIONS</string>
    <string name="lesson_subdivisions_body">Every bar holds 16 steps. Hit every fourth step to lock the pulse, then split the gaps to double the speed.</string>
    <string name="lesson_swing_title">SWING</string>
    <string name="lesson_swing_body">Push the off beat a little late. The loop starts to breathe and the groove leans forward instead of marching.</string>
    <string name="lesson_syncopation_title">SYNCOPATION</string>
    <string name="lesson_syncopation_body">Leave the strong beat empty and place the hit just before it. The ear fills the silence and the loop pulls ahead.</string>

